 originalNote:['英文原文請見下方原書頁面；本站英文導讀是另行撰寫的解說。','The original book appears in the page viewer. The English guide is newly authored teaching material.'],
 sourceNote:['保留原書圖表、公式與排版。頁面可能同時包含相鄰小節。','Original charts, equations, and layout are preserved. A page may also contain neighboring sections.'],
 loadSource:['載入本節原書頁面','Load original book pages'],openPdf:['開啟原書 PDF','Open original PDF'],
 printPage:['書頁','Book page'],pdfPage:['PDF 頁','PDF page'],pagePrev:['前一頁','Previous page'],pageNext:['後一頁','Next page'],
 complete:['標記本節已讀','Mark as read'],completed:['本節已讀','Marked as read'],
 completionNote:['慢慢理解就好。讀過與練習通過會分開記錄。','Take your time. Reading progress and quiz results are tracked separately.'],
