 check:['查看答案與解釋','Check answer'],retry:['重新作答','Try again'],correct:['答對了，看看理由。','Correct. Here is why.'],
 incorrect:['再想一下，這是判斷的關鍵。','Take another look at the reasoning.'],selectFirst:['請先選擇一個答案。','Choose an answer first.'],
