 allChapters:['查看全部 20 章','Explore all 20 chapters'],start:['開始學習','Start learning'],continue:['繼續閱讀','Continue reading'],
 exercise:['原書習題','Book exercises'],translationNote:['依原書段落翻譯；公式、程式碼與數值保留。白話導讀另列補充。','Translated from the source paragraphs; formulas, code and numbers are preserved. Concept notes are separate supplements.'],
 loadingPdf:['正在載入原書，第一次可能需要一些時間…','Loading the original book. The first load may take a moment…'],
 sourceText:['本節起始頁擷取文字（公式請核對原書）','Extracted text from this section’s starting pages (check equations against the book)'],
